{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05728","headline":"孤寝怨 · 崔珪","name":"孤寝怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征戍动经年，含情拂玳筵。\n花飞织锦处，月落捣衣边。\n灯暗愁孤坐，牀空怨独眠。\n自君辽海去，玉匣闭春弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}